      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense for a literature review. To round it out, can you explain how they address the criticisms regarding environmental or socioeconomic factors? Basically, I want to know how they argue that the data they cite isn't just a result of much better access to resources or schooling for certain groups versus others. How do they distinguish between a \"cultural\" gap and a \"biological\" one in their arguments?",
